17
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
But that's it for this episode of The Streamlined Solopreneur. I hope you enjoyed it. Go check out the Solopreneur System Starter Kit. That's a mouthful. And remember, being a solopreneur does not mean doing everything yourself.

18
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Thanks so much for listening. And until next time, I hope you find some space in your week.
